      "full_page": "TO KNOW GOD MY CREATOR is the purpose of my creation, the supreme end and aim of my existence as a rational creature. This includes everything and gives a purpose to each and all sciences, human and divine. God made me to know Him. Oh: What a bles'd aim! To love Him and serve Him sure rests in the same. It's Heaven-begun, for the grateful, on earth. -- To treasure aright! ? ! Highest Heaven its worth. God Himself is the reward -- infinitely great -- both, here and hereafter of those who strive",
